cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "spherex-quicklook: a quick-look library for NASA SPHEREx images"
abstract: >-
  Per-visit stacks, difference images, light curves and 102-channel spectra
  measured from NASA SPHEREx images in the IRSA archive, with Gaia DR3 and
  CatWISE2020 overlays. The library behind the SPHEREx Flipbook app (paramost),
  built for the NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026 (Planet X and SPHEREx).
type: software
